  "description": {
    "en": "Babolat RPM Team is a softer spin-oriented co-polyester string designed for players who want the control and spin of the RPM family with a more forgiving response. Its octagonal profile improves ball bite and spin, while the low-density co-polyester construction produces a softer and more tolerant feel than firmer polyester strings such as RPM Blast. It is particularly well suited to intermediate and advanced players seeking modern spin performance without excessive stiffness.",

    "zh": "Babolat RPM Team 是 RPM 系列中偏柔和、偏容错的一款旋转型共聚酯球线。八边形截面能够提升咬球能力和旋转表现，而低密度共聚酯结构则让击球手感比 RPM Blast 更柔和、更容易驾驭。它非常适合喜欢 RPM 系列控制与旋转，但希望降低聚酯线硬度和提升舒适性的中高级球员。"
  },

